# Local development variables. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) to use.
#
# Optional Cloudflare Realtime TURN credentials — used by /api/turn to vend
# short-lived ICE credentials so peers behind symmetric NATs can establish
# WebRTC data channels. Leave unset to fall back to STUN-only.
#
# Create a TURN key: Cloudflare Dashboard → Realtime → TURN → Create key.
TURN_KEY_ID=""
TURN_API_TOKEN=""
